(2. Coverage) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.1 In-patient Hospitalisation Expenses) Tj T*
(The insurer will indemnify medically necessary expenses incurred for in-patient) Tj T*
(hospitalisation during the policy period, including room and boarding, nursing, intensive) Tj T*
(care, surgeon and consultant fees, operation theatre charges, medicines and drugs, and) Tj T*
(diagnostic tests, subject to the limits, waiting periods, exclusions and cost-sharing in) Tj T*
(this policy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.2 Room Rent Limit) Tj T*
(Room rent, boarding and nursing charges are payable up to INR 6,000 per day of) Tj T*
(hospitalisation. Any room rent charged above INR 6,000 per day is not payable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.3 Intensive Care Unit Limit) Tj T*
(Intensive care unit charges are payable up to INR 12,000 per day of stay in the intensive) Tj T*
(care unit. Charges above this limit are not payable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2.4 Pre and Post Hospitalisation) Tj T*
(Medical expenses incurred up to 30 days before admission and up to 60 days after discharge) Tj T*
(for the same condition are payable, provided the in-patient claim is admissible.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
