(3. Waiting Periods) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.1 Initial Waiting Period) Tj T*
(Expenses for any illness contracted within the first 30 days from the first policy) Tj T*
(commencement date are not payable. This initial waiting period does not apply to) Tj T*
(hospitalisation caused by an accident.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.2 Pre-existing Diseases) Tj T*
(Expenses related to a pre-existing disease declared or detected at proposal are payable only) Tj T*
(after 36 months of continuous coverage from the first policy commencement date.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3.3 Specified Diseases and Procedures) Tj T*
(Treatment of the following is payable only after 24 months of continuous coverage: cataract,) Tj T*
(hernia, joint replacement, kidney stone, sinusitis, tonsillectomy, varicose veins. This) Tj T*
(waiting period does not apply when treatment is required because of an accident.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
