(4. Exclusions) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.1 Cosmetic and Aesthetic Treatment) Tj T*
(Cosmetic, aesthetic or plastic surgery, including weight reduction and hair transplant, is) Tj T*
(not payable unless required to treat an injury caused by an accident.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.2 Alcohol, Substance Abuse and Self-inflicted Injury) Tj T*
(Treatment arising from alcohol or drug abuse, intoxication, or intentional self-inflicted) Tj T*
(injury is not payable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.3 Non-medical Items and Consumables) Tj T*
(Non-medical items and consumables such as gloves, masks, admission kits, registration and) Tj T*
(file charges, toiletries and attendant charges are not payable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.4 Maternity) Tj T*
(Expenses for childbirth, caesarean section and pregnancy-related treatment are not payable) Tj T*
(under this policy.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4.5 Unproven and Experimental Treatment) Tj T*
(Treatment that is experimental, investigational or not based on established medical practice) Tj T*
(is not payable.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
