(5. Cost Sharing) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.1 Deductible) Tj T*
(A deductible of INR 5,000 applies to each admissible hospitalisation claim. The deductible) Tj T*
(is subtracted from the admissible amount before co-payment.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.2 Co-payment) Tj T*
(A co-payment of 10% of the admissible amount remaining after the deductible is borne by the) Tj T*
(insured on every claim.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5.3 Maximum Liability) Tj T*
(The total amount payable for all claims in a policy year will not exceed the available sum) Tj T*
(insured.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
