(6. Claims Procedure) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.1 Claim Notification) Tj T*
(The insured must notify the insurer within 48 hours of an emergency admission and at least) Tj T*
(48 hours before a planned admission.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.2 Documents Required) Tj T*
(A hospitalisation claim must include the duly filled claim form, the discharge summary, the) Tj T*
(final hospital bill with itemised breakup, and payment receipts. The insurer may request) Tj T*
(investigation reports where needed.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(6.3 Claim Settlement) Tj T*
(The insurer will settle or reject a claim within 30 days of receiving the last necessary) Tj T*
(document. Any rejection will be communicated in writing with the specific policy clause) Tj T*
(relied upon.) Tj T*
ET
